+\paragraph{Result R71: analytic pole residues, their connection and their endpoint.}
+Return to the original $h$-potential $\Phi_h'=h$ with its
+specified additive constant. For fixed $u\ne0$, write
+$w=e^{(\Phi_h(s)-ts)/u}$ and let
